    <entry>
      <title>Arch Linux 软件包管理与 AUR 进阶</title>
      <link href="/2026/08/26/arch-linux-package-aur/"/>
      <url>/2026/08/26/arch-linux-package-aur/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<blockquote><p><code>pacman</code> 管官方仓库，AUR 补社区软件——二者合力，几乎能装到你想得到的任何东西。</p></blockquote><p>前两篇讲完了安装与基础配置，本篇深入 <strong>包管理器的进阶玩法</strong>：从 <code>pacman</code> 高阶命令，到亲手编写 <code>PKGBUILD</code> 打包，再到常见故障处理。</p><div class="admonition info"><div class="admonition-title">Info</div><p><strong>本篇你将学到</strong></p><ul><li><code>pacman</code> 常用与冷门命令速查</li><li>包缓存、降级与忽略更新</li><li>AUR 原理与 <code>yay</code> 进阶</li><li>自己编写并发布 <code>PKGBUILD</code></li><li>依赖冲突、密钥问题的解决办法</li></ul></div><hr><h2 id="1-Pacman-命令速查"><a href="#1-Pacman-命令速查" class="headerlink" title="1. Pacman 命令速查"></a>1. Pacman 命令速查</h2><table><thead><tr><th>操作</th><th>命令</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>安装</td><td><code>pacman -S 包名</code></td></tr><tr><td>搜索（仓库）</td><td><code>pacman -Ss 关键字</code></td></tr><tr><td>搜索（已装）</td><td><code>pacman -Qs 关键字</code></td></tr><tr><td>删除（保留依赖）</td><td><code>pacman -R 包名</code></td></tr><tr><td>删除并清理依赖</td><td><code>pacman -Rns 包名</code></td></tr><tr><td>列出已安装</td><td><code>pacman -Q</code></td></tr><tr><td>查看包内文件</td><td><code>pacman -Ql 包名</code></td></tr><tr><td>安装本地包</td><td><code>pacman -U 包.pkg.tar.zst</code></td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="2-缓存、降级与忽略"><a href="#2-缓存、降级与忽略" class="headerlink" title="2. 缓存、降级与忽略"></a>2. 缓存、降级与忽略</h2><p>Pacman 会把下载的包缓存在 <code>/var/cache/pacman/pkg/</code>，这不仅能节省重复下载，还能用于<strong>回滚版本</strong>：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">ls</span> /var/cache/pacman/pkg/ | grep 包名          <span class="comment"># 找到旧版本缓存</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> pacman -U /var/cache/.../旧版本.pkg.tar.zst  <span class="comment"># 降级安装</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>如需长期跳过某些易出问题的包，可在 <code>/etc/pacman.conf</code> 中配置：</p><figure class="highlight ini"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">IgnorePkg</span> = linux nvidia</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><div class="admonition warning"><div class="admonition-title">Warning</div><p><code>IgnorePkg</code> 是把双刃剑。长期忽略<strong>内核</strong>可能导致显卡驱动不兼容，请仅在明确需要时使用，并尽快恢复更新。</p></div><h2 id="3-AUR-是什么"><a href="#3-AUR-是什么" class="headerlink" title="3. AUR 是什么"></a>3. AUR 是什么</h2><p>AUR 由社区维护，存放官方仓库尚未收录软件的 <code>PKGBUILD</code>。它<strong>不能直接</strong>用 <code>pacman</code> 安装，需要：</p><ol><li>手动 <code>git clone</code> + <code>makepkg</code>（上一篇文章已演示）</li><li>或使用 AUR 助手（<code>yay</code> &#x2F; <code>paru</code>）</li></ol><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">yay -S 包名       <span class="comment"># 同时检索官方源与 AUR</span></span><br><span class="line">yay -Ss 关键字    <span class="comment"># 仅搜索</span></span><br><span class="line">paru -S 包名</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="4-进阶：手写-PKGBUILD"><a href="#4-进阶：手写-PKGBUILD" class="headerlink" title="4. 进阶：手写 PKGBUILD"></a>4. 进阶：手写 PKGBUILD</h2><p>当某个软件连 AUR 都没有时，你可以自己打包。一个最小示例：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">mkdir</span> mypkg &amp;&amp; <span class="built_in">cd</span> mypkg</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">cat</span> &gt; PKGBUILD &lt;&lt;<span class="string">&#x27;EOF&#x27;</span></span><br><span class="line">pkgname=hello</span><br><span class="line">pkgver=1.0</span><br><span class="line">pkgrel=1</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">arch</span>=(x86_64)</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">source</span>=(<span class="string">&quot;https://example.com/hello-<span class="variable">$pkgver</span>.tar.gz&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">sha256sums=(<span class="string">&#x27;SKIP&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="function"><span class="title">build</span></span>() &#123;</span><br><span class="line">  <span class="built_in">cd</span> <span class="string">&quot;<span class="variable">$pkgname</span>-<span class="variable">$pkgver</span>&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line">  make</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="function"><span class="title">package</span></span>() &#123;</span><br><span class="line">  <span class="built_in">cd</span> <span class="string">&quot;<span class="variable">$pkgname</span>-<span class="variable">$pkgver</span>&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line">  make DESTDIR=<span class="string">&quot;<span class="variable">$pkgdir</span>&quot;</span> install</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line">EOF</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">makepkg -si          <span class="comment"># 编译并安装</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>发布前做一下自检：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">namcap PKGBUILD                      <span class="comment"># 检查常见错误与缺失依赖</span></span><br><span class="line">makepkg --printsrcinfo &gt; .SRCINFO    <span class="comment"># 生成 SRCINFO（AUR 必需）</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="5-依赖冲突与密钥问题"><a href="#5-依赖冲突与密钥问题" class="headerlink" title="5. 依赖冲突与密钥问题"></a>5. 依赖冲突与密钥问题</h2><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 导入缺失的 GPG 密钥</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> pacman-key --recv-keys 密钥ID</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> pacman-key --lsign-key 密钥ID</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 数据库损坏时重建</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> pacman -Syy</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 谨慎地强制覆盖冲突文件</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> pacman -S --overwrite <span class="string">&#x27;*&#x27;</span> 包名</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><div class="admonition danger"><div class="admonition-title">Danger</div><p><code>--overwrite '*'</code> 会无条件覆盖文件，<strong>可能破坏其它包</strong>。请先用 <code>pacman -Qo 文件</code> 确认冲突来源，把它作为最后的手段。</p></div><h2 id="6-进阶：archlinuxcn-社区源"><a href="#6-进阶：archlinuxcn-社区源" class="headerlink" title="6. 进阶：archlinuxcn 社区源"></a>6. 进阶：archlinuxcn 社区源</h2><p>国内常用的社区源，提供大量预编译软件，省去自己编译的麻烦：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 在 /etc/pacman.conf 末尾追加</span></span><br><span class="line">[archlinuxcn]</span><br><span class="line">Server = https://mirrors.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/archlinuxcn/<span class="variable">$arch</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 安装密钥环并刷新</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> pacman -S archlinuxcn-keyring</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> pacman -Syu</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h2 id="小结"><a href="#小结" class="headerlink" title="小结"></a>小结</h2><p>至此，你已经真正<strong>玩转了 Arch 的包管理体系</strong>：</p><ul><li>用 <code>pacman</code> 精准控制官方包；</li><li>用 <code>yay</code> 畅游 AUR；</li><li>必要时还能自己写 <code>PKGBUILD</code> 打包发布。</li></ul><p>这正是 Arch「难者不会，会者不难」的魅力——把系统的每一颗螺丝都交到你手里。祝你用得开心 🐧</p>]]></content>
      
      
