    <entry>
      <title>Arch Linux 基础配置与日常使用指南</title>
      <link href="/2026/08/25/arch-linux-basic-config/"/>
      <url>/2026/08/25/arch-linux-basic-config/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<blockquote><p>装好系统只是第一步。真正的 Arch 体验，从你亲手把它「调教」成顺手的工具开始。</p></blockquote><p>上一篇我们装好了最小系统，本篇将补齐<strong>桌面环境、中文输入法、常用软件以及日常维护</strong>的基本操作。</p><div class="admonition info"><div class="admonition-title">Info</div><p><strong>本篇你将学到</strong></p><ul><li>安装并启用 KDE / Xfce 桌面环境</li><li>配置 AUR 助手 <code>yay</code> 与中文输入法</li><li>系统滚动更新与清理的正确姿势</li><li>systemd 服务管理与基础排错</li></ul></div><hr><h2 id="1-安装桌面环境"><a href="#1-安装桌面环境" class="headerlink" title="1. 安装桌面环境"></a>1. 安装桌面环境</h2><p>以 <strong>KDE Plasma</strong> 为例（完整桌面 + 应用套件）：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> pacman -S xorg plasma plasma-wayland-session kde-applications</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> systemctl <span class="built_in">enable</span> sddm</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> systemctl start sddm</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>如果你更偏爱轻量桌面，可以选择 <strong>Xfce</strong>：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> pacman -S xfce4 xfce4-goodies lightdm</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> systemctl <span class="built_in">enable</span> lightdm</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> systemctl start lightdm</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="2-配置-AUR-助手-yay"><a href="#2-配置-AUR-助手-yay" class="headerlink" title="2. 配置 AUR 助手 yay"></a>2. 配置 AUR 助手 yay</h2><p>AUR（Arch User Repository）是 Arch 生态的精华所在。先装好 <code>yay</code>，之后就能用一行命令安装社区维护的软件：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> pacman -S git base-devel</span><br><span class="line">git <span class="built_in">clone</span> https://aur.archlinux.org/yay.git</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">cd</span> yay &amp;&amp; makepkg -si</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">cd</span> .. &amp;&amp; <span class="built_in">rm</span> -rf yay</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>装好后，所有 AUR 包都可以这样安装：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">yay -S 包名</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="3-必备软件推荐"><a href="#3-必备软件推荐" class="headerlink" title="3. 必备软件推荐"></a>3. 必备软件推荐</h2><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 浏览器</span></span><br><span class="line">yay -S google-chrome</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 终端与编辑器</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> pacman -S alacritty neovim tmux</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 中文输入法 fcitx5</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> pacman -S fcitx5 fcitx5-chinese-addons fcitx5-im</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">echo</span> -e <span class="string">&quot;GTK_IM_MODULE=fcitx\nQT_IM_MODULE=fcitx\nXMODIFIERS=@im=fcitx&quot;</span> &gt;&gt; ~/.pam_environment</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 开发工具链</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> pacman -S git base-devel python nodejs npm</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><div class="admonition tip"><div class="admonition-title">Tip</div><p>配置完 fcitx5 后，<strong>注销重新登录</strong>输入法才会生效。若仍无法切换，检查是否安装了对应前端（如 <code>fcitx5-gtk</code> / <code>fcitx5-qt</code>）。</p></div><h2 id="4-滚动更新与维护"><a href="#4-滚动更新与维护" class="headerlink" title="4. 滚动更新与维护"></a>4. 滚动更新与维护</h2><p>Arch 是滚动发行版，更新频繁但也很简单：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> pacman -Syu     <span class="comment"># 更新官方仓库</span></span><br><span class="line">yay -Sua             <span class="comment"># 更新 AUR 包</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>定期清理可以让系统保持轻盈：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> pacman -Rns $(pacman -Qtdq)   <span class="comment"># 删除孤立的依赖包</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> pacman -Scc                   <span class="comment"># 清理下载缓存</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><div class="admonition warning"><div class="admonition-title">Warning</div><p>更新<strong>内核或 glibc</strong> 等大件后建议重启。遇到大规模更新前，不妨先浏览官方公告 <a href="https://archlinux.org/news/">archlinux.org/news</a>，避免踩坑。</p></div><h2 id="5-服务管理（systemd）"><a href="#5-服务管理（systemd）" class="headerlink" title="5. 服务管理（systemd）"></a>5. 服务管理（systemd）</h2><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> systemctl start nginx      <span class="comment"># 启动服务</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> systemctl <span class="built_in">enable</span> nginx     <span class="comment"># 设为开机自启</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> systemctl status nginx     <span class="comment"># 查看运行状态</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> journalctl -u nginx -f     <span class="comment"># 实时查看服务日志</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="6-日志与排错"><a href="#6-日志与排错" class="headerlink" title="6. 日志与排错"></a>6. 日志与排错</h2><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> systemctl --failed     <span class="comment"># 列出启动失败的服务</span></span><br><span class="line">dmesg -l err,warn           <span class="comment"># 查看内核层的错误/警告</span></span><br><span class="line">pacman -Qo /usr/bin/python  <span class="comment"># 查询某文件属于哪个包</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><div class="admonition tip"><div class="admonition-title">Tip</div><p>遇到「文件已存在」之类的冲突时，先用 <code>pacman -Qo 文件路径</code> 确认归属，再决定覆盖还是移除，不要盲目 <code>--overwrite '*'</code>。</p></div><hr><h2 id="小结"><a href="#小结" class="headerlink" title="小结"></a>小结</h2><p>到这一步，你的 Arch 已经是一台可以<strong>日常办公、开发</strong>的机器了。</p><p>想进一步解锁 Arch 的精髓？下一篇 👉 <strong>《Arch Linux 软件包管理与 AUR 进阶》</strong> 将深入 <code>pacman</code> 高级用法，并教你手写 <code>PKGBUILD</code> 打包自己的软件。</p>]]></content>
      
      
