    <entry>
      <title>Arch Linux 安装教程：从零开始打造你的系统</title>
      <link href="/2026/08/25/arch-linux-install/"/>
      <url>/2026/08/25/arch-linux-install/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<blockquote><p>「保持简单」是 Arch Linux 的信条。它给你一个最小、纯净、滚动更新的系统，其余的一切由你决定。</p></blockquote><p>本教程将带你走完从制作启动盘到进入可用桌面前的<strong>全部安装流程</strong>。只要跟着步骤走，即使是第一次接触 Arch，也能装出一台属于自己的机器。</p><div class="admonition info"><div class="admonition-title">Info</div><p><strong>适用前提</strong></p><ul><li>目标机器为 <code>x86_64</code> 架构，且以 <strong>UEFI</strong> 模式启动</li><li>准备一个容量 ≥ 4GB 的 U 盘</li><li>确保有稳定的网络（安装过程需联网下载包）</li></ul></div><hr><h2 id="1-制作启动盘"><a href="#1-制作启动盘" class="headerlink" title="1. 制作启动盘"></a>1. 制作启动盘</h2><p>从镜像站下载最新 ISO，并写入 U 盘（以下在 Linux 下操作）：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 下载镜像（以清华源为例）</span></span><br><span class="line">curl -LO https://mirrors.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/archlinux/iso/latest/archlinux-x86_64.iso</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 写入 U 盘，注意 of=/dev/sdX 要换成你的真实设备</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> <span class="built_in">dd</span> <span class="keyword">if</span>=archlinux-x86_64.iso of=/dev/sdX bs=4M status=progress oflag=<span class="built_in">sync</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><div class="admonition warning"><div class="admonition-title">Warning</div><p><code>/dev/sdX</code> 一旦写错，会<strong>清空该磁盘上的所有数据</strong>！可用 <code>lsblk</code> 确认设备名后再执行。</p></div><p>从 U 盘启动后，你会看到 <code>root@archiso ~ #</code> 这样的提示符，说明已进入 Live 环境。</p><h2 id="2-连接网络"><a href="#2-连接网络" class="headerlink" title="2. 连接网络"></a>2. 连接网络</h2><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 有线网络一般插上即用；无线网络使用 iwctl</span></span><br><span class="line">iwctl</span><br><span class="line">device list</span><br><span class="line">station wlan0 scan</span><br><span class="line">station wlan0 get-networks</span><br><span class="line">station wlan0 connect <span class="string">&quot;你的WiFi名&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">exit</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 验证网络是否通畅</span></span><br><span class="line">ping -c 3 archlinux.org</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="3-磁盘分区（UEFI-GPT）"><a href="#3-磁盘分区（UEFI-GPT）" class="headerlink" title="3. 磁盘分区（UEFI + GPT）"></a>3. 磁盘分区（UEFI + GPT）</h2><p>假设目标磁盘为 <code>/dev/nvme0n1</code>，使用交互式分区工具：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">cgdisk /dev/nvme0n1</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>推荐的分区方案如下：</p><table><thead><tr><th>挂载点</th><th>分区类型</th><th>建议大小</th><th>用途</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>/boot</code></td><td>EFI (<code>ef00</code>)</td><td>512M</td><td>引导文件</td></tr><tr><td><code>/</code></td><td>Linux (<code>8300</code>)</td><td>剩余空间</td><td>根文件系统</td></tr><tr><td><em>(可选)</em></td><td>Linux swap (<code>8200</code>)</td><td>2–4G</td><td>交换分区</td></tr></tbody></table><p>格式化并挂载：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">mkfs.fat -F32 /dev/nvme0n1p1</span><br><span class="line">mkfs.ext4 /dev/nvme0n1p2</span><br><span class="line">mount /dev/nvme0n1p2 /mnt</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">mkdir</span> /mnt/boot</span><br><span class="line">mount /dev/nvme0n1p1 /mnt</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="4-安装基础系统"><a href="#4-安装基础系统" class="headerlink" title="4. 安装基础系统"></a>4. 安装基础系统</h2><p>可先用 <code>reflector</code> 优选国内镜像源，加快下载速度：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">reflector --country China --age 12 --protocol https --<span class="built_in">sort</span> rate --save /etc/pacman.d/mirrorlist</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>安装核心软件包：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">pacstrap /mnt base linux linux-firmware base-devel vim networkmanager</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="5-配置新系统"><a href="#5-配置新系统" class="headerlink" title="5. 配置新系统"></a>5. 配置新系统</h2><p>生成 fstab 并进入新系统：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">genfstab -U /mnt &gt;&gt; /mnt/etc/fstab</span><br><span class="line">arch-chroot /mnt</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>在新环境内完成基础设置：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 时区</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">ln</span> -sf /usr/share/zoneinfo/Asia/Shanghai /etc/localtime</span><br><span class="line">hwclock --systohc</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 本地化</span></span><br><span class="line">sed -i <span class="string">&#x27;s/^#zh_CN.UTF-8/zh_CN.UTF-8/&#x27;</span> /etc/locale.gen</span><br><span class="line">locale-gen</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">echo</span> <span class="string">&quot;LANG=zh_CN.UTF-8&quot;</span> &gt; /etc/locale.conf</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 主机名与用户</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">echo</span> <span class="string">&quot;myarch&quot;</span> &gt; /etc/hostname</span><br><span class="line">passwd                                    <span class="comment"># 设置 root 密码</span></span><br><span class="line">useradd -m -G wheel -s /bin/bash ethan    <span class="comment"># 创建普通用户</span></span><br><span class="line">passwd ethan</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">echo</span> <span class="string">&quot;%wheel ALL=(ALL:ALL) ALL&quot;</span> &gt;&gt; /etc/sudoers.d/wheel</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="6-安装引导程序"><a href="#6-安装引导程序" class="headerlink" title="6. 安装引导程序"></a>6. 安装引导程序</h2><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">pacman -S grub efibootmgr</span><br><span class="line">grub-install --target=x86_64-efi --efi-directory=/boot --bootloader-id=Arch</span><br><span class="line">grub-mkconfig -o /boot/grub/grub.cfg</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>启用网络服务，退出并重启：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">systemctl <span class="built_in">enable</span> NetworkManager</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">exit</span></span><br><span class="line">umount -R /mnt</span><br><span class="line">reboot</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><div class="admonition tip"><div class="admonition-title">Tip</div><p>重启时记得<strong>拔掉 U 盘</strong>，否则可能再次进入安装环境。启动后用刚创建的 <code>ethan</code> 用户登录即可。</p></div><hr><h2 id="小结"><a href="#小结" class="headerlink" title="小结"></a>小结</h2><p>至此，你拥有了一台<strong>纯净的 Arch Linux 基础系统</strong>。它还没有图形界面，但已经是一个完整、可启动的 Linux。</p><p>接下来该做什么？请阅读下一篇 👉 <strong>《Arch Linux 基础配置与日常使用指南》</strong>，我们将安装桌面环境、中文输入法与常用软件，让它真正「好用」起来。</p>]]></content>
      
      
